  "releaseNotes": "* Add Without, which resets a property to its default value (null for reference and nullable types)\n\t\t* Add XML documentation for the public API\n\t\t* Enable nullable reference type annotations\n\t\t* Property pickers must now select a property directly on the parameter; fields, static, captured, indexed and casted nested properties throw InvalidOperationException (previously some silently set the wrong property)\n\t\t* Throw ArgumentNullException when the value factory passed to With is null",
